{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Anyone with frizzy hair &amp; flyaways<br> For an at home hair spa<br> Someone with a sensitive scalp<br> Anyone searching for a conditioner infused with botanicals and herbs.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Distilled Lavender water, Distilled Lemon Water , Behentrimonium chloride, Glycol di-Stearate, Isopropyl Alcohol, Vegetable Glycerin, Shea butter, Quaternium-80, Propylene glycol, Acetyl tetrapeptide-3, Dextran, Polyquaternium-7, Hydrolysed Collagen, Hydrolysed keratin, Olea europaea (Olive) fruit oil, Argania spinosa kernel (Argan) oil, Sclerocarya birrea (Marula) seed oil, Panthenol, Butylene glycol, Vitamin E, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Hydroxide, Coconut milk, Tocopherol, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium metabisulfite, Sodium Benzoate, Sorbic Acid, Lavender Essential oil, Rose Essential Oil</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This is a conditioning hair mask that has the Himalayan lavender, which is great to reduce dryness and lock in moisture. While it is not 100% natural, it has safe chemicals used in a mild proportion. It is great to improve volume and keep the hair shiny.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This conditioner is unique because it is made with Himalayan herbs that balance the Vata Dosha and reduce dryness in the hair. It has botanical infusions that repair the hair while conditioning it.<br> </span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
